    "title": "FHU celebrates 2026 Roar Awards presented by FirstBank - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Dustin Semore FHU Sports Information Director ,\n12 hours ago The Freed-Hardeman University Lions and Lady Lions traded their uniforms for suits and dressed to celebrate the fourth annual Roar Awards presented by FirstBank on Tuesday, May 5. In the gala, nearly 500 student-athletes, family and friends celebrated the accomplishments of the 2025-26 season with a Cinco de Mayo themed dinner. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
